3. Time Complexity

Revised:

O(1)
O(log n)
O(n)
O(n log n)
O(n²)

Examples:
- accessing an array element → O(1)
- linear search → O(n)
- binary search → O(log n)

Purpose:
Understand how to evaluate solution efficiency.


